# Runtime data.
#
# Anchored with a leading slash on purpose. An unanchored `cache/` matches at
# every depth, which silently excluded `proxy/src/cache/` — the source tree
# built fine locally and the committed tree did not.
/data/
/cache/
proxy/data/
web/data/
